1
00:00:00,225 --> 00:00:03,565
(Stuart:)Of course it is. It's a little wrong
to say a tomato is a vegetable.

2
00:00:03,729 --> 00:00:06,819
(Stuart:)It's very wrong to say
it's a suspension bridge.

3
00:00:08,191 --> 00:00:11,651
(Stuart:)But returning to the original issue,
Dick Grayson became Nightwing.

4
00:00:11,820 --> 00:00:13,240
(Stuart:)A superhero in his own right.

5
00:00:13,405 --> 00:00:16,115
"Batman Two" has to be the second Robin,
Jason Todd.

6
00:00:16,533 --> 00:00:19,573
"Has to be"? "Has to be"?

7
00:00:19,828 --> 00:00:22,668
(Sheldon:)I hope you're being
deliberately provocative.

8
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:25,500
PENNY: I found the decaf.
- Oh, great.

9
00:00:25,667 --> 00:00:28,667
(Sheldon:)Yeah, herbal tea for me, please.

10
00:00:31,340 --> 00:00:34,970
Barkeep, Alexander me.

11
00:00:35,761 --> 00:00:37,391
(Leonard:)How about those two?

12
00:00:37,554 --> 00:00:39,434
No, they're eating peanuts.

13
00:00:39,598 --> 00:00:43,648
With my allergies, one kiss
would put me in Cedars-Sinai for a week.

14
00:00:45,771 --> 00:00:48,101
(Leonard:)What about the ones in the corner?

15
00:00:48,273 --> 00:00:51,233
(Howard:)Possible. Very possible.

16
00:00:51,401 --> 00:00:54,691
(Howard:)You want the one in the whiplash collar
or the one who keeps blinking?

17
00:00:55,697 --> 00:00:58,787
- I think Blinky's cute.
- Done, sir.

